{"title":"Career Roadmap · Dancer","role":"Dancer","summary":"A professional Dancer specializes in performance, interpretation, choreography, training, and presentation through movement.","facts":{"Current degree":"BPA (Bachelor of Performing Arts)","Course":"Classical Dance (Bharatanatyam, Kuchipudi, Kathak, Odissi, etc.)"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A professional Dancer specializes in performance, interpretation, choreography, training, and presentation through movement."},{"type":"p","text":"For a BPA student specializing in Indian Classical Dance, the career combines:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Technique","Abhinaya","Music","Rhythm","Performance","Cultural Knowledge","Stagecraft"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Depending on the specialization, the dancer may work as:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Solo performer"},{"text":"Ensemble dancer"},{"text":"Stage performer"},{"text":"Dance teacher"},{"text":"Choreographer"},{"text":"Cultural performer"},{"text":"Theatre/film performer"},{"text":"Dance researcher"},{"text":"Workshop instructor"},{"text":"Performing-arts educator"},{"text":"Digital dance creator"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Classical dance careers are strongly portfolio- and performance-based. A degree provides academic and artistic structure, but consistent practice, performances, repertoire, mentorship, and professional visibility are crucial."}]},{"heading":"Career Pathway","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"flow","items":["Class 12","BPA – Classical Dance","Intensive Technique Training","College Performances","Stage / Festival Performances","Professional Dancer","Senior / Featured Performer","Choreographer / Dance Educator / Solo Artist","Dance Company / Independent Artist / Academy"]},{"type":"h","text":"Alternative academic pathway"},{"type":"flow","items":["BPA Classical Dance","Performance Experience","MA / MPA Dance","Dance Research / Teaching","Univers