ormance"},{"text":"Improvisation where appropriate to the tradition"},{"text":"Stagecraft"},{"text":"Performance interpretation"},{"text":"Choreographic understanding"},{"text":"Audience communication"},{"text":"Cultural context"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Students should begin developing their individual artistic identity."}]},{"heading":"Final Year — Professional Portfolio","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Use the final year to establish a professional performance profile."},{"type":"p","text":"Create:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Professional performance reel"},{"text":"High-quality photographs"},{"text":"Solo repertoire"},{"text":"Group-performance documentation"},{"text":"Artist biography"},{"text":"Performance CV"},{"text":"Festival participation record"},{"text":"Workshop record"},{"text":"Choreography samples"}]}]},{"heading":"Core Dancer Skill Stack","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Skill","Priority"],"rows":[[{"text":"Classical Technique"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Rhythm / Tala"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Abhinaya"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Repertoire"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Musicality"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Body Control"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Flexibility"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Strength"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Stamina"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Stage Presence"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Performance Interpretation"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Rehearsal Discipline"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Cultural Knowledge"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Collaboration"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Choreography"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Teaching"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Digital Portfolio"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐"}]]}]},{"heading":"Technique Development","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A professional dancer needs structured daily practice."},{"type":"h","text":"Example practice framework"},{"type":"flow","items":["Warm-up","Mobility","Basic Technique","Footwork","Hand / Body Coordination","Rhythm Practice","Repertoire","Abhinaya","Choreography","Cool-down"]},{"type":"p","text":"The exact duration and exercises should be adapted to the dancer's tradition, physical condition, training level, and teacher's guidance."}]},{"heading":"Physical Conditioning","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Dance requires physical preparation."},{"type":"p","text":"Important areas:"},{"type":"h","text":"Strength"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Core"},{"text":"Legs"},{"text":"Glutes"},{"text":"Back"},{"text":"Feet/ankles"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Mobility"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Hips"},{"text":"Ankles"},{"text":"Spine"},{"text":"Shoulders"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Conditioning"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Cardiovascular endurance"},{"text":"Muscular endurance"},{"text":"Balance"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Recovery"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Rest"},{"text":"Hydration"},{"text":"Nutrition"},{"text":"Mobility work"},{"text":"Appropriate recovery"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Avoid excessive training through significant pain. Persistent pain or injury should be assessed by an appropriate healthcare professional."}]},{"heading":"Musicality","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A classical dancer should understand the relationship between:"},{"type":"flow","items":["movement","rhythm","melody","lyrics","expression"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Tala"},{"text":"Laya"},{"text":"Rhythm patterns"},{"text":"Musical structure"},{"text":"Tempo"},{"text":"Lyrics"},{"text":"Musical cues"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Performance relationship"},{"type":"flow","items":["Music","Rhythm","Movement","Expression","Narrative"]}]},{"heading":"Abhinaya","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Abhinaya is central to many Indian classical dance traditions, though its treatment differs across styles."},{"type":"p","text":"Develop:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Facial expression"},{"text":"Eye movement"},{"text":"Hand gestures"},{"text":"Body language"},{"text":"Characterization"},{"text":"Emotional interpretation"},{"text":"Storytelling"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The objective is to communicate meaning to the audience without relying exclusively on spoken language."}]},{"heading":"Stagecraft","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A professional dancer needs more than technical dance ability."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Stage positioning"},{"text":"Lighting awareness"},{"text":"Costume management"},{"text":"Makeup"},{"text":"Props"},{"text":"Entrances and exits"},{"text":"Backstage discipline"},{"text":"Performance timing"},{"text":"Sound coordination"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Technical rehearsal"},{"type":"flow","items":["Stage","Lighting","Sound","Music Cue","Entrance","Movement","Costume / Props","Full Run"]}]},{"heading":"Rehearsal Skills","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Professional performance depends heavily on disciplined rehearsal."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Memorization"},{"text":"Repetition"},{"text":"Counting"},{"text":"Spatial awareness"},{"text":"Formation changes"},{"text":"Cue recognition"},{"text":"Working with choreographers"},{"text":"Taking corrections"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Rehearsal process"},{"type":"flow","items":["Learn Movement","Practice Slowly","Add Rhythm","Add Music","Add Expression","Full Run","Correction","Repeat"]}]},{"heading":"Stage Presence","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Develop:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Confidence"},{"text":"Eye focus"},{"text":"Spatial awareness"},{"text":"Facial expression"},{"text":"Controlled energy"},{"text":"Audience connection"},{"text":"Performance consistency"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Stage presence is developed through repeated performance, not simply classroom practice."}]},{"heading":"Choreography Skills","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Even if the primary goal is to become a dancer, learning 